<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.25 billion 7-day yields avg 2.859 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.25 billion 7-day yields avg 2.859 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada on Wednesday said its C$1.25 billion auction of seven-day T-bills due February 6, 1997 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD   PRICE</p>
<p>			  AVG   2.859 99.94521  PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    2.800 99.94633  HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    2.950 99.94346  55.7</p>
<p>The bills will be dated and issued on January 30.</p>
<p>The central bank bought none of the bills.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
